  30:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * @section DESCRIPTION
  31:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** *
  32:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * The GetAlarmSummary service is used by a client BACnet-user
  33:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * to obtain a summary of "active alarms." The term "active alarm" refers
  34:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * to BACnet standard objects that have an Event_State property whose value
  35:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * is not equal to NORMAL and a Notify_Type property whose value is ALARM.
  36:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * The GetEnrollmentSummary service provides a more sophisticated approach
  37:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** * with various kinds of filters
  38:../src/middleware/bacnet/src/get_alarm_sum.c **** */
